# Root-level excludes for the OMARISE backend mono-folder (7 Spring Boot services).
# Each service already has its own .gitignore (target/, .idea/, etc.) — this one
# only needs to cover things that sit directly at this root, one level up from
# any service's own .gitignore.

# Root-level IntelliJ project files (each service also has its own .idea/, already
# covered by its own .gitignore)
.idea/

# Local scratch/output from AI-assisted development sessions — demo data, seed
# scripts, prompts — not part of the actual services. Remove this line if you'd
# rather keep this folder in the repo.
Claude outputs/

# Per-service local secrets profile (contains real credentials — never commit)
**/application-local.yml

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Secrets pour docker-compose (valeurs réelles, jamais committées)
.env
